*KEYWORD 30M
*COMMENT
Simulation setup for Rear impact of PMHS reported by Yoganandan et al. 2000

The validation report can be accessed on the VIVA+ validation catalog at 
https://vivaplus-validation.readthedocs.io/

The validation setup and experimental data used in this simulation 
were published in

Yoganandan, N., & Pintar, F. (2000). 
Biomechanics of human occupants in simulated rear crashes: 
documentation of neck injuries and comparison of injury criteria (No. 2000-01-SC14). 
SAE Technical Paper.

This VIVA+ validation is published in:
John, J., Putra, I. P. A., & Iraeus, J. (2022). 
Finite Element Human Body Models to study Sex-differences in Whiplash Injury: 
Validation of VIVA+ passive response in rear-impact.
https://www.ircobi.org/wordpress/downloads/irc22/pdf-files/2236.pdf

The validation simulation was setup by 
Jobin John   
If you ave any questions, contact: vivaplus@ovto.org

The models are available for reuse. Please see the 'env' and 'vivaplus'
folders for additional information on licenses specific to the 
simulation environment and VIVA+ models.

This is version 1, released on 19-10-2022

Unit System of the model: mm-ms-kg-kN

Funding acknowledgment: This project received funding from the 
European Union's Horizon 2020 Research and Innovation Programme 
under grant agreement No 768960 (Project VIRTUAl).
https://projectvirtual.eu/
